  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Judges",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 3,
    "summary": "The children of Israel intermarry with the Canaanites, worship false gods, and are cursed—Othniel judges the Israelites—They serve Moab and are delivered by Ehud, who slays Eglon.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Now these are the nations which the Lord left, to prove Israel by them, even as many of Israel as had not known all the wars of Canaan;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 10,
            "end": 13
          },
          {
            "start": 72,
            "end": 76
          },
          {
            "start": 85,
            "end": 94
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Judges 3:1",
        "book": "Judges",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Only that the generations of the children of Israel might know, to teach them war, at the least such as before knew nothing thereof;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Judges 3:2",
        "book": "Judges",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Namely, five lords of the Philistines, and all the Canaanites, and the Sidonians, and the Hivites that dwelt in mount Lebanon, from mount Baal-hermon unto the entering in of Hamath.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 12,
            "text": "Josh. 13:3."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 7
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Josh. 13:3.",
            "prettyString": "Joshua 13:3",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "joshua",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 13,
                    "end": 13,
                    "verses": [
                      {
