        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Judges 3:7",
        "book": "Judges",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Therefore the anger of the Lord was hot against Israel, and he sold them into the hand of Chushan-rishathaim king of Mesopotamia: and the children of Israel served Chushan-rishathaim eight years.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Judges 3:8",
        "book": "Judges",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "And when the children of Israel cried unto the Lord, the Lord raised up a deliverer to the children of Israel, who delivered them, even Othniel the son of Kenaz, Caleb’s younger brother.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 74,
            "end": 83,
            "text": "Neh. 9:27. TG Deliver."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 131,
            "end": 135
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Judges 3:9",
        "book": "Judges",
        "chapter": 3,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And the Spirit of the Lord came upon him, and he judged Israel, and went out to war: and the Lord delivered Chushan-rishathaim king of Mesopotamia into his hand; and his hand prevailed against Chushan-rishathaim.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 14,
            "text": "TG God, Spirit of."
          },
          {
            "start": 193,
            "end": 211,
            "text": "Hab. 3:7."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG God, Spirit of.",
            "prettyString": "TG God, Spirit of",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "God, Spirit of",
                "entryId": "tg-god-spirit-of",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "raw": "Hab. 3:7.",
            "prettyString": "Habakkuk 3:7",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "habakkuk",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 3,
                    "end": 3,
